OL,3,GNEWSABody found in search for missing
OL,4,Ateenager
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice searching for a man who went
OL,7,Fmissing from Portishead say they have
OL,8,Ffound a body.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police said items of
OL,11,Fclothing on the body found in water
OL,12,Fnear Newport, Wales, matched those of
OL,13,Fan 18 year-old named George who was
OL,14,Flast seen on Thursday 17 September.
OL,16,FOfficers said George's family had been
OL,17,Ftold, although formal identification
OL,18,Fwas yet to take place.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
